      "comment": "FLEE WITH ME (6) back in grade and trip and gets in light with the claim. Failed to close off in the soft (7) going when sixth over 2000m at Quirindi. That followed a win at Dubbo at the previous outing. Blinkers go on and has the ability to produce another win. INARTICULATE (4) first run for the new yard he held on well to finish fourth over 1400m at Carinda a week ago. Steps up in journey today. Can park just off the speed and give a great sight. JUPITER HILLS (7) has not won for a long while. Last raced on July 10 when tenth over 1400m at Scone. Placed to advantage and expect a bold run. HIMEROS (3) is next best.",
